Package: shinyMat
Title: A Lightweight Editable Matrix Input for Shiny
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person('Yihui', 'Xie', email = 'xie@yihui.name', role = c('aut', 'cre', 'cph'),
    comment = c(ORCID = '0000-0003-0645-5666', URL = 'https://yihui.org'))
Description: An editable matrix (grid of text inputs) as a Shiny input, with a
    dependency-free vanilla-JavaScript client binding. Create a matrix input
    with 'matrixInput()' and update it from the server with
    'updateMatrixInput()'. A trimmed, Vue-free reimplementation of the subset of
    the 'shinyMatrix' widget needed by typical apps: a static header row of
    column names plus editable cells, with server-driven resets.
Imports:
    htmltools,
    shiny,
    utils
